(6162366, 908404, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far in this challenge. In fact, I think I will fave it.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far in this challenge. In fact, I think I will fave it.', '2010-09-15 02:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
