(6162723, 909374, 114233, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little TOO underexposed... but its hard to know what other voters will think. Would have loved to have seen a little more detail</td>', 'Maybe a little TOO underexposed... but its hard to know what other voters will think. Would have loved to have seen a little more detail', '2010-09-15 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162734, 908472, 80908, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent idea for the challenge.', '2010-09-15 10:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162735, 908945, 80908, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but not sure it is actually underexposed. Maybe my fault for liking the darker shot!</td>', 'I really like the shot, but not sure it is actually underexposed. Maybe my fault for liking the darker shot!', '2010-09-15 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162736, 908553, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great concept and sky, but seems a little unbalanced - the fleet keeps dragging my eye down to the very bottom, where it is abruptly cut off. Perhaps more of the sea would make it more ''comfortable'' to view?</td>', 'Great concept and sky, but seems a little unbalanced - the fleet keeps dragging my eye down to the very bottom, where it is abruptly cut off. Perhaps more of the sea would make it more ''comfortable'' to view?', '2010-09-15 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162737, 909664, 80908, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the backlighting - if there was any way of separating the dog ''standing watch'' from the girl he is protecting, it might have more impact.</td>', 'I love the idea and the backlighting - if there was any way of separating the dog ''standing watch'' from the girl he is protecting, it might have more impact.', '2010-09-15 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162738, 909581, 80908, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful and arty. Perhaps playing to the current arty trend? Any which way, I do like it.</td>', 'Simple, beautiful and arty. Perhaps playing to the current arty trend? Any which way, I do like it.', '2010-09-15 10:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162739, 909443, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and balance. I like being able to just see both eyes in the darkness.</td>', 'Nice lighting and balance. I like being able to just see both eyes in the darkness.', '2010-09-15 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162741, 909400, 114233, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm. Sky and waterfall look correctly exposed and the rocks clearly underexposed... but what is the main subject of the photo?</td>', 'Hmmmmm. Sky and waterfall look correctly exposed and the rocks clearly underexposed... but what is the main subject of the photo?', '2010-09-15 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162742, 909030, 80908, '<td valign="top">A classic concept, nicely done but the colours are a little dull - perhaps this would work better in BW?</td>', 'A classic concept, nicely done but the colours are a little dull - perhaps this would work better in BW?', '2010-09-15 10:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162745, 909662, 80908, '<td valign="top">It''s an okay sky, but lacks impact. Why am I looking at it? What is happening here? The lit house is just a bit confusing.</td>', 'It''s an okay sky, but lacks impact. Why am I looking at it? What is happening here? The lit house is just a bit confusing.', '2010-09-15 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162746, 908651, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great concept - the lurking menace in the shadows - but the lighting doesn''t work for me. Perhaps backlit would be more menacing?</td>', 'Great concept - the lurking menace in the shadows - but the lighting doesn''t work for me. Perhaps backlit would be more menacing?', '2010-09-15 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162749, 908575, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice flower, but slightly over-exposed I would say - it would also benefit from a little more sharpness.</td>', 'Nice flower, but slightly over-exposed I would say - it would also benefit from a little more sharpness.', '2010-09-15 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162751, 909653, 80908, '<td valign="top">Interesting and very arty realisation of the challenge idea.</td>', 'Interesting and very arty realisation of the challenge idea.', '2010-09-15 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162753, 908898, 80908, '<td valign="top">Well exposed for the sky, underexposed for the fence. A difficult shot to call. It certainly looks like a very peaceful scene. I would probably have brought the foreground into focus more and perhaps gone for a POV which really made it the subject of the shot - perhaps ground up silhouetting the stile for impact?</td>', 'Well exposed for the sky, underexposed for the fence. A difficult shot to call. It certainly looks like a very peaceful scene. I would probably have brought the foreground into focus more and perhaps gone for a POV which really made it the subject of the shot - perhaps ground up silhouetting the stile for impact?', '2010-09-15 11:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162754, 909246, 80908, '<td valign="top">I love the balance of this shot - the V of birds meeting the V of the tree. Nice timing.</td>', 'I love the balance of this shot - the V of birds meeting the V of the tree. Nice timing.', '2010-09-15 11:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162755, 909656, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of the challenge requirement to isolate this beautiful subject.</td>', 'Great composition and use of the challenge requirement to isolate this beautiful subject.', '2010-09-15 11:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162757, 909598, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition - marginal on the ''underexposed'' bit though!</td>', 'Nice framing and composition - marginal on the ''underexposed'' bit though!', '2010-09-15 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162768, 909639, 80908, '<td valign="top">He''s a cracker, but I''m not sure he is really underexposed.</td>', 'He''s a cracker, but I''m not sure he is really underexposed.', '2010-09-15 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162769, 909127, 80908, '<td valign="top">Fun shot - I like the strange light effects inside the half-tube.</td>', 'Fun shot - I like the strange light effects inside the half-tube.', '2010-09-15 11:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162774, 909664, 114233, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Tells a story but sadly the focus doesnt seem to be on the girl</td>', 'Lovely. Tells a story but sadly the focus doesnt seem to be on the girl', '2010-09-15 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162778, 908891, 80908, '<td valign="top">Finally - real use of underexposure to add effect! Fine work. The only downside is the tilted rear horizon. I am not convinced that the top two inches add anything - maybe they could have just been cropped off?</td>', 'Finally - real use of underexposure to add effect! Fine work. The only downside is the tilted rear horizon. I am not convinced that the top two inches add anything - maybe they could have just been cropped off?', '2010-09-15 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162781, 909457, 114233, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and lovely colours</td>', 'Gorgeous and lovely colours', '2010-09-15 11:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162784, 909654, 33736, '<td valign="top">This might be underexposed, but I love the mood of it. 8</td>', 'This might be underexposed, but I love the mood of it. 8', '2010-09-15 11:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162786, 909443, 33736, '<td valign="top">"Underexposed" to the good.  (Have to say though, that the little white areas near her armpit, and the strange twisting of her bodice are a bit distracting for me.)  All in all, it''s a terrific portrait.</td>', '"Underexposed" to the good.  (Have to say though, that the little white areas near her armpit, and the strange twisting of her bodice are a bit distracting for me.)  All in all, it''s a terrific portrait.', '2010-09-15 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162791, 909617, 80908, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lovely, ethereal quality. The bokeh at the top really works for me too. Nice job.</td>', 'This shot has a lovely, ethereal quality. The bokeh at the top really works for me too. Nice job.', '2010-09-15 11:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162803, 909448, 33736, '<td valign="top">Hard vote - the background is underexposed, but the foreground and middle section are almost glowing!  This entry (uneven horizon line, nonwithstanding) really appeals to me.</td>', 'Hard vote - the background is underexposed, but the foreground and middle section are almost glowing!  This entry (uneven horizon line, nonwithstanding) really appeals to me.', '2010-09-15 11:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162804, 909080, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great shot - the darkness really adds here and it is tack sharp. I do hope the poor fellow isn''t being kept in a cupboard though?!</td>', 'Great shot - the darkness really adds here and it is tack sharp. I do hope the poor fellow isn''t being kept in a cupboard though?!', '2010-09-15 11:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6162806, 909374, 115827, '<td valign="top">masterpice</td>', 'masterpice', '2010-09-15 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
