(6163171, 908472, 108580, '<td valign="top">Agreed, it''s often over-rated. Smooth cloudless gradations (like this) are also very appealing. WD.</td>', 'Agreed, it''s often over-rated. Smooth cloudless gradations (like this) are also very appealing. WD.', '2010-09-15 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
