(6163187, 908917, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hell of a shot in so many ways, but it''s not speaking to the challenge topic for me. The defining characteristic of this image is more OVERexposure than UNDERexposure, it''s a pretty much high-key shot. I like it very much, however.</td>', 'Hell of a shot in so many ways, but it''s not speaking to the challenge topic for me. The defining characteristic of this image is more OVERexposure than UNDERexposure, it''s a pretty much high-key shot. I like it very much, however.', '2010-09-15 17:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
