(6163193, 909617, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a ribbon in my book so far, but I''m only halfway. Wonderful image! Fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Wow! This is a ribbon in my book so far, but I''m only halfway. Wonderful image! Fits the challenge nicely.', '2010-09-15 17:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
