(6163264, 909484, 108069, '<td valign="top">The tones and colors in this are absolutely beautiful. So rich. I hope it does well (I''m not voting), but to be honest, I love it like this and can''t imagine it not in these dark tones. Of course that''s without seeing it. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'The tones and colors in this are absolutely beautiful. So rich. I hope it does well (I''m not voting), but to be honest, I love it like this and can''t imagine it not in these dark tones. Of course that''s without seeing it. Beautiful photo.', '2010-09-15 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
