(6163518, 909189, 54778, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!</td>', 'LOVE IT!', '2010-09-15 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163520, 908877, 40391, '<td valign="top">This confuses me(hehe)<br/> <br/>I do like what has been achieved with the SDoF.  I wasn''t sure about the bright area on the RHS but when I covered with my hand I felt the picture worked better without it (for me anyay).  Overall I do like this - statue?  7.</td>', 'This confuses me(hehe) I do like what has been achieved with the SDoF.  I wasn''t sure about the bright area on the RHS but when I covered with my hand I felt the picture worked better without it (for me anyay).  Overall I do like this - statue?  7.', '2010-09-15 23:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163522, 908636, 107190, '<td valign="top">This is a very captivating shot - love the red and blue tones that break the shadows, great composition</td>', 'This is a very captivating shot - love the red and blue tones that break the shadows, great composition', '2010-09-15 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163532, 909550, 40391, '<td valign="top">A lovely abstact of a draw handle which nicely meets the challenge. 8.</td>', 'A lovely abstact of a draw handle which nicely meets the challenge. 8.', '2010-09-15 23:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163574, 908659, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the violet blue tones.</td>', 'I like the violet blue tones.', '2010-09-16 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163575, 909089, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur on the front boat. Gorgeous blues and lavenders.</td>', 'Love the motion blur on the front boat. Gorgeous blues and lavenders.', '2010-09-16 00:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163580, 909467, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is almost perfect.  I wish his right hand wasn''t covering his face.  I also think there is just a bit too much negative space on the right.  But the lighting is terrific.</td>', 'This is almost perfect.  I wish his right hand wasn''t covering his face.  I also think there is just a bit too much negative space on the right.  But the lighting is terrific.', '2010-09-16 00:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163584, 909189, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I actually have a shot of the rear end of one of these, so between you and me we have a whole tortoise :-)  Love the lighting and detail in this capture.</td>', 'I love this.  I actually have a shot of the rear end of one of these, so between you and me we have a whole tortoise :-)  Love the lighting and detail in this capture.', '2010-09-16 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163586, 909612, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really good detail and tones in this image.  I''m not sure the angle is the strongest choice. Maybe either more vertical or more straight on.</td>', 'Really good detail and tones in this image.  I''m not sure the angle is the strongest choice. Maybe either more vertical or more straight on.', '2010-09-16 00:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163588, 908438, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love mice!!!  This one is so sweet.  I think I might have cropped a bit off the top to make it horizontal and to bring the eye sooner to it.</td>', 'I love mice!!!  This one is so sweet.  I think I might have cropped a bit off the top to make it horizontal and to bring the eye sooner to it.', '2010-09-16 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163591, 909400, 96751, '<td valign="top">It may sound odd, but this is a very "masculine" image.  Very bold tones and solid shapes, with just the softness of the water and mist for contrast.  Very appealing.</td>', 'It may sound odd, but this is a very "masculine" image.  Very bold tones and solid shapes, with just the softness of the water and mist for contrast.  Very appealing.', '2010-09-16 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163597, 909521, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really good here (although I would have liked the lit parts just a tiny bit more lit)  But it''s the crop that''s a little odd to me, although the composition - his placement in the frame - works well.  Maybe even a little less space off the right would be even better?</td>', 'The lighting is really good here (although I would have liked the lit parts just a tiny bit more lit)  But it''s the crop that''s a little odd to me, although the composition - his placement in the frame - works well.  Maybe even a little less space off the right would be even better?', '2010-09-16 00:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163598, 908605, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the ocean when it sparkles like this.</td>', 'I love the ocean when it sparkles like this.', '2010-09-16 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163599, 909629, 96751, '<td valign="top">These look like dancers, with the back one leaping.</td>', 'These look like dancers, with the back one leaping.', '2010-09-16 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163600, 909345, 96751, '<td valign="top">Having taken one of these, I know how hard it is to get it so clear.  But I think cropping this tight you did a disservice to the image since there is no motion blur - it looks like it''s standing still.</td>', 'Having taken one of these, I know how hard it is to get it so clear.  But I think cropping this tight you did a disservice to the image since there is no motion blur - it looks like it''s standing still.', '2010-09-16 00:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163603, 909490, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful abstract.  Love motion blur, and weimberaners.  Great combination!</td>', 'What a beautiful abstract.  Love motion blur, and weimberaners.  Great combination!', '2010-09-16 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163608, 908404, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!!!!  Simple, yet eloquent.  The break in the mist is perfectly placed.  Love it</td>', 'Marvelous!!!!  Simple, yet eloquent.  The break in the mist is perfectly placed.  Love it', '2010-09-16 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163640, 909345, 15511, '<td valign="top">Image is too closely cropped on the left and right sides. Nice crisp image, though, using just enough range of tones to give the car shape and define the paint scheme.</td>', 'Image is too closely cropped on the left and right sides. Nice crisp image, though, using just enough range of tones to give the car shape and define the paint scheme.', '2010-09-16 00:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163670, 909634, 94241, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, it''s hard to relate to a photo where I''m not actually sure what it''s a photo of.  I think this is a close up of a gun?  I ''unno, I can''t quite wrap my head around it.</td>', 'I have to admit, it''s hard to relate to a photo where I''m not actually sure what it''s a photo of.  I think this is a close up of a gun?  I ''unno, I can''t quite wrap my head around it.', '2010-09-16 01:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163672, 909633, 94241, '<td valign="top">To me this isn''t underexposed.  I struggled with this on picking my own photo.  I finally decided underexposed meant, to me, that except for small patches of highlight, everything was on the low end of the histogram.</td>', 'To me this isn''t underexposed.  I struggled with this on picking my own photo.  I finally decided underexposed meant, to me, that except for small patches of highlight, everything was on the low end of the histogram.', '2010-09-16 01:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163677, 908552, 94241, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time thinking of this as underexposed, as the majority of the pixels are in the top half of the histogram.  Absolutely stunning image though.</td>', 'I have a hard time thinking of this as underexposed, as the majority of the pixels are in the top half of the histogram.  Absolutely stunning image though.', '2010-09-16 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163678, 909639, 96751, '<td valign="top">A phenomenal bug macro although I don''t see how this is underexposed.</td>', 'A phenomenal bug macro although I don''t see how this is underexposed.', '2010-09-16 02:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163679, 908895, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think there are some strong elements in this image, although it''s a bit too underexposed.  The eye is drawn to the window with the partial building rather than to the man, who is arguably the main subject.  His pose is very interesting, he is pondering something, but he is almost invisible, s the eye keeps traveling to the better lit window.</td>', 'I think there are some strong elements in this image, although it''s a bit too underexposed.  The eye is drawn to the window with the partial building rather than to the man, who is arguably the main subject.  His pose is very interesting, he is pondering something, but he is almost invisible, s the eye keeps traveling to the better lit window.', '2010-09-16 02:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163680, 909080, 96751, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting.  This bear looks like he has a lot of war stories.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Superb lighting.  This bear looks like he has a lot of war stories.  Beautiful image.', '2010-09-16 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163681, 908553, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like an image for skyscape.  I''m not sure it qualifies for underexposed...</td>', 'This looks like an image for skyscape.  I''m not sure it qualifies for underexposed...', '2010-09-16 02:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163682, 909539, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am always amazed at images that are this dark and yet retail such clarity.  Well done.</td>', 'I am always amazed at images that are this dark and yet retail such clarity.  Well done.', '2010-09-16 02:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163683, 909520, 96751, '<td valign="top">An attractive abstract, although I''m not sure what I''m looking at...</td>', 'An attractive abstract, although I''m not sure what I''m looking at...', '2010-09-16 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163684, 909625, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of image I hope to some day be able to capture.  Not sure what this is, although it seems organic.  But the level of detail in the focused area, and the spectacular bokeh above, oh, just gorgeous.</td>', 'This is the sort of image I hope to some day be able to capture.  Not sure what this is, although it seems organic.  But the level of detail in the focused area, and the spectacular bokeh above, oh, just gorgeous.', '2010-09-16 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163686, 908891, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, technically, I think this is silhouette rather than underexposed.  But I could be wrong.  It might be the same thing :-) Beautiful and simple.</td>', 'Hmmm, technically, I think this is silhouette rather than underexposed.  But I could be wrong.  It might be the same thing :-) Beautiful and simple.', '2010-09-16 02:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163687, 908552, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning it its simplicity. Wonderful pp''ing.  I would argue that a crop on the right to match the left would make a better balanced image.</td>', 'Stunning it its simplicity. Wonderful pp''ing.  I would argue that a crop on the right to match the left would make a better balanced image.', '2010-09-16 02:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163688, 908991, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous.  A real story image.  I love the starburst, and that there is just enough light on the ground to make out the figure.  Gorgeous tonality.</td>', 'Marvelous.  A real story image.  I love the starburst, and that there is just enough light on the ground to make out the figure.  Gorgeous tonality.', '2010-09-16 02:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163689, 908917, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, cats = fabulous.  So you got me on the heart factor.  Plus them cuddling, adds cute factor.  Plus killer processing and the whole yin/yang, hugging thing.  BUT, technically not really underexposed.  On the contrary, this is a bit overexposed.  Love it anyway.</td>', 'Ok, cats = fabulous.  So you got me on the heart factor.  Plus them cuddling, adds cute factor.  Plus killer processing and the whole yin/yang, hugging thing.  BUT, technically not really underexposed.  On the contrary, this is a bit overexposed.  Love it anyway.', '2010-09-16 02:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163691, 909510, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail in the water.  I just love the steam coming off it.</td>', 'Wonderful detail in the water.  I just love the steam coming off it.', '2010-09-16 02:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163693, 909665, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me, the face is a fabulous example of underexposed photography. However, the terrific bokeh behind her fights against the simple lines of the face.  The very textured background fights for attention.</td>', 'For me, the face is a fabulous example of underexposed photography. However, the terrific bokeh behind her fights against the simple lines of the face.  The very textured background fights for attention.', '2010-09-16 02:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163694, 909444, 96751, '<td valign="top">To  me, this is contre jour, not underexposed.  All these terms are confusing, and I could be totally wrong.  Nevertheless, it is a gorgeous image, and great detail on the stem on the left, and the head on the right.  Beautiful.</td>', 'To  me, this is contre jour, not underexposed.  All these terms are confusing, and I could be totally wrong.  Nevertheless, it is a gorgeous image, and great detail on the stem on the left, and the head on the right.  Beautiful.', '2010-09-16 02:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163695, 908945, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image.  The mist is almost tactile, and a great foil for the tree.  I''d like to see a square crop on this image though.</td>', 'Gorgeous image.  The mist is almost tactile, and a great foil for the tree.  I''d like to see a square crop on this image though.', '2010-09-16 02:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163696, 908373, 96751, '<td valign="top">A most unusual image for sure.  There is so much to look at and several techniques to enjoy.  The motion blur of the hands, the terrific emotion in the face portrait, the bg people.</td>', 'A most unusual image for sure.  There is so much to look at and several techniques to enjoy.  The motion blur of the hands, the terrific emotion in the face portrait, the bg people.', '2010-09-16 02:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163697, 909513, 96751, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s grinning!!!</td>', 'He looks like he''s grinning!!!', '2010-09-16 02:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163698, 908669, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very serene.</td>', 'Very serene.', '2010-09-16 02:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163699, 908850, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Well done.  Nice "portrait", and perfect lighting.  It might have been even better in b/w.</td>', 'LOL!  Well done.  Nice "portrait", and perfect lighting.  It might have been even better in b/w.', '2010-09-16 02:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163702, 909461, 96751, '<td valign="top">I almost passed this by.  A very unusual image to be sure.  Definitely underexposed, and the green patch behind him really draws the eye to the main subject.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I almost passed this by.  A very unusual image to be sure.  Definitely underexposed, and the green patch behind him really draws the eye to the main subject.  Beautiful.', '2010-09-16 02:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163703, 909587, 96751, '<td valign="top">A terrific mood shot.  The sky is marvelous</td>', 'A terrific mood shot.  The sky is marvelous', '2010-09-16 02:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163704, 909496, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m feeling very ambiguous about this image.  Her face is beautifully lit, but just way  too lit for underexposed.  On the other hand, her body is underexposed, but by such a large extent when compared to the face, that the face seems disembodied. In addition, it''s also a different color. but this also makes it a very interesting image.</td>', 'I''m feeling very ambiguous about this image.  Her face is beautifully lit, but just way  too lit for underexposed.  On the other hand, her body is underexposed, but by such a large extent when compared to the face, that the face seems disembodied. In addition, it''s also a different color. but this also makes it a very interesting image.', '2010-09-16 02:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163706, 908636, 96751, '<td valign="top">A circle and a square.  Great abstract.</td>', 'A circle and a square.  Great abstract.', '2010-09-16 02:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163707, 908544, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although I adore cheetahs, and this is a stunning capture, and very beautifully processed, I can''t imagine how it could be considered underexposed.</td>', 'Although I adore cheetahs, and this is a stunning capture, and very beautifully processed, I can''t imagine how it could be considered underexposed.', '2010-09-16 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
