(6163710, 909584, 96751, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image.  I imagine you processed as a negative to get this coloring.  However, I don''t see this as underexposed.</td>', 'Intriguing image.  I imagine you processed as a negative to get this coloring.  However, I don''t see this as underexposed.', '2010-09-16 02:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
