(6163835, 908404, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my word!!  This grabbed me from the thumbs.  Perfect use of blur, subtle diagonal line, negative space and silhouette.  I love it.</td>', 'Oh my word!!  This grabbed me from the thumbs.  Perfect use of blur, subtle diagonal line, negative space and silhouette.  I love it.', '2010-09-16 09:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163837, 908895, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this with the only highlight being the white house and roofline outside of the lower right window.  It has mood and tells a story.</td>', 'I really like this with the only highlight being the white house and roofline outside of the lower right window.  It has mood and tells a story.', '2010-09-16 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163838, 909617, 76585, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of this shot, nice editing. 8</td>', 'I love the texture of this shot, nice editing. 8', '2010-09-16 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163839, 909484, 15711, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I don''t really consider it underexposed as this is perfect, but it is slightly low key.  I love it.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I don''t really consider it underexposed as this is perfect, but it is slightly low key.  I love it.', '2010-09-16 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163841, 908605, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s funny because I don''t truly consider this underexposed, yet I love it.  As the late light glistens on the water, a single ship floats across the horizon.  Nicely seen. 7</td>', 'It''s funny because I don''t truly consider this underexposed, yet I love it.  As the late light glistens on the water, a single ship floats across the horizon.  Nicely seen. 7', '2010-09-16 09:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163843, 909570, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love it.  This is truly underexposed and my kind of shot.  In a normal challenge, "too dark" would probably be what you''d hear from the masses, yet it is intriguing and invites me to study it further.  Love the vanishing point. 8</td>', 'Oh I love it.  This is truly underexposed and my kind of shot.  In a normal challenge, "too dark" would probably be what you''d hear from the masses, yet it is intriguing and invites me to study it further.  Love the vanishing point. 8', '2010-09-16 09:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163845, 908651, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like how he has mostly shadows on his face.  I think a BW conversion would have made it even more sinister. :)</td>', 'I like how he has mostly shadows on his face.  I think a BW conversion would have made it even more sinister. :)', '2010-09-16 09:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163846, 908991, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  The flare from the light is perfect!!!  Very noir with plenty of mystery. I like having to study it to figure it out. 8</td>', 'Oh I love this.  The flare from the light is perfect!!!  Very noir with plenty of mystery. I like having to study it to figure it out. 8', '2010-09-16 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163848, 909324, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Subtle.  I love the shadowy tones in the bokeh.</td>', 'Lovely.  Subtle.  I love the shadowy tones in the bokeh.', '2010-09-16 10:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163849, 909385, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the reflections. I have the feeling this would look much better printed really big.</td>', 'Nice use of the reflections. I have the feeling this would look much better printed really big.', '2010-09-16 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163852, 909550, 80908, '<td valign="top">Very simple and clean - great use of light and darkness. I''m thinking Mapplethorpe.</td>', 'Very simple and clean - great use of light and darkness. I''m thinking Mapplethorpe.', '2010-09-16 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163853, 909080, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I adore this.  Is he a Steiff?  I would have preferred a bit more negative space, but as it is, it is still quite impacting.  I like it a lot.  The glint in that beady little eye gives him such character.  Subtlety is highly underrated on DPC.  8</td>', 'Oh I adore this.  Is he a Steiff?  I would have preferred a bit more negative space, but as it is, it is still quite impacting.  I like it a lot.  The glint in that beady little eye gives him such character.  Subtlety is highly underrated on DPC.  8', '2010-09-16 10:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163854, 908757, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great colours and realisation of the challenge concept.</td>', 'Great colours and realisation of the challenge concept.', '2010-09-16 10:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163855, 909089, 15711, '<td valign="top">So rich and painterly. lI ove the "ghost boat."</td>', 'So rich and painterly. lI ove the "ghost boat."', '2010-09-16 10:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163856, 909577, 80908, '<td valign="top">As with some of the other shots, I think this would look better printed huge. It is still a great shot though - a really strong sense of peace and solitude.</td>', 'As with some of the other shots, I think this would look better printed huge. It is still a great shot though - a really strong sense of peace and solitude.', '2010-09-16 10:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163857, 909595, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed.  My eye travels throughout the page ending on the swan swimming out of the shot. The balance of him and the light reflective area in the back is really nice. 8</td>', 'Beautifully composed.  My eye travels throughout the page ending on the swan swimming out of the shot. The balance of him and the light reflective area in the back is really nice. 8', '2010-09-16 10:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163858, 908669, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Such a soft quiet moment.</td>', 'Stunning. Such a soft quiet moment.', '2010-09-16 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163859, 909252, 80908, '<td valign="top">Tricky. This is a lovely shot, balanced, sharp etc, but I would say it is a perfectly exposed night shot rather than an underexposed shot.</td>', 'Tricky. This is a lovely shot, balanced, sharp etc, but I would say it is a perfectly exposed night shot rather than an underexposed shot.', '2010-09-16 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163860, 908707, 15711, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC.  That single eye''s glint makes the shot.  I love your use of negative space.  9</td>', 'FANTASTIC.  That single eye''s glint makes the shot.  I love your use of negative space.  9', '2010-09-16 10:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163861, 909647, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great shot and realisation of your concept, but the title throws me - I don''t think I have the story!</td>', 'Great shot and realisation of your concept, but the title throws me - I don''t think I have the story!', '2010-09-16 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1);
