(6164003, 909647, 117831, '<td valign="top">Because this is underexposed it adds to the element of mystery and such! great job and very creative! top 3!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=900812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/117831/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_900812.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Because this is underexposed it adds to the element of mystery and such! great job and very creative! top 3! ', '2010-09-16 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
