(6165253, 909592, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think with a subject such as this you really needed to crank it down. If just the highlights of her muscles and bracelet popped through while other parts of her body faded away (like the hair is starting to do) I think that would have been stronger for this challenge. Cool photo though.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting, but that''s what I see here.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think with a subject such as this you really needed to crank it down. If just the highlights of her muscles and bracelet popped through while other parts of her body faded away (like the hair is starting to do) I think that would have been stronger for this challenge. Cool photo though. I''m not voting, but that''s what I see here.', '2010-09-18 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6165254, 908544, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo, and makes me feel like I''m watching an old nature film, but I don''t think it''s underexposed enough. I''m not voting, but I''d imagine this stellar image might be suffering because of the challenge theme.</td>', 'Outstanding photo, and makes me feel like I''m watching an old nature film, but I don''t think it''s underexposed enough. I''m not voting, but I''d imagine this stellar image might be suffering because of the challenge theme.', '2010-09-18 08:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
