(6165574, 908877, 83149, '<td valign="top">I like it, but not much usage of underexposure, just shallow depth of field.</td>', 'I like it, but not much usage of underexposure, just shallow depth of field.', '2010-09-18 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
