(6166565, 909510, 60495, '<td valign="top">I think if the horizon was leveled and the crop done differently I would have liked this one a lot, I like the color tones and the subject and although its not a true underexposure the low lighting works. One thing that really bothers me is the buoy on the right, it looks really out of place and IMO is a big distraction and should have been left out of the shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think if the horizon was leveled and the crop done differently I would have liked this one a lot, I like the color tones and the subject and although its not a true underexposure the low lighting works. One thing that really bothers me is the buoy on the right, it looks really out of place and IMO is a big distraction and should have been left out of the shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-09-20 00:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
