(6169149, 908741, 3569, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by michelaudette:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice scenery but you reduced the contrast, not the exposure which makes the picture very flat. </i></td></tr></table>  Nope, didn''t do anything but underexpose it.</td>', 'Originally posted by michelaudette: Nice scenery but you reduced the contrast, not the exposure which makes the picture very flat.   Nope, didn''t do anything but underexpose it.', '2010-09-22 09:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6169152, 908552, 120432, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the votes. I am very honored and surprised! As with most good shots this one was an accident. I was taking pictures of the hummingbirds at first light and the geese came flying in over the water. I turned around and snapped several quick shots of them as they landed with the sun to their backs. I look forward to more contests,as I think they really improve my quality of picture taking...Everyone have a blessed day and thank you.....Juliann</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the votes. I am very honored and surprised! As with most good shots this one was an accident. I was taking pictures of the hummingbirds at first light and the geese came flying in over the water. I turned around and snapped several quick shots of them as they landed with the sun to their backs. I look forward to more contests,as I think they really improve my quality of picture taking...Everyone have a blessed day and thank you.....Juliann', '2010-09-22 09:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6169163, 909595, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb, Rob.  Top 10 once again for you. Congrats.</td>', 'Superb, Rob.  Top 10 once again for you. Congrats.', '2010-09-22 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
